},{"role":"tool","sequence":92,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"[{\"id\":\"eth1\",\"network\":\"ethereum\",\"gas_asset\":\"ETH\",\"gas_per_tx\":\"300000000000000\",\"balances\":{\"ETH\":\"47900000000000000\",\"WBTC\":\"0\",\"USDC\":\"0\"}},{\"id\":\"rh1\",\"network\":\"robinhood\",\"gas_asset\":\"ETH\",\"gas_per_tx\":\"20000000000000\",\"balances\":{\"ETH\":\"49346533333333333\",\"WBTC\":\"0\"}},{\"id\":\"arb1\",\"network\":\"arbitrum\",\"gas_asset\":\"ETH\",\"gas_per_tx\":\"20000000000000\",\"balances\":{\"ETH\":\"113333333333333\",\"WBTC\":\"0\",\"USDC\":\"147699600\"}}]","toolCallId":"toolu_017u9VjZJWBiNxaGAvtgs1v5","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_list_accounts","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":93,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_report_result","arguments":{"summary":"Done. All 7 steps confirmed and your 0.1 ETH is now ETH on Robinhood Chain and USDC on Arbitrum. Total cost was $10.22, under your $15.00 limit.\n\nWhat happened, in order:\n1. Sent 0.0003 ETH from Ethereum to rh1 for gas; 0.000133 ETH arrived after the bridge fee.\n2. Sent 0.0003 ETH from Ethereum to arb1 for gas; 0.000133 ETH arrived.\n3. Swapped 0.1 ETH for 495,000 sats of WBTC on eth1.\n4. Moved half the WBTC (247,500 sats) to rh1; 246,666 sats arrived.\n5. Moved the other half (247,500 sats) to arb1; 246,666 sats arrived.\n6. Swapped 246,666 sats of WBTC on rh1 for 0.049213 ETH.\n7. Swapped 246,666 sats of WBTC on arb1 for 147.6996 USDC.\n\nBalances now (base units in brackets):\n- **eth1 (Ethereum):** 0.0479 ETH (47900000000000000). WBTC and USDC are 0.\n- **rh1 (Robinhood Chain):** 0.049347 ETH (49346533333333333). That's the swap output plus the gas ETH that's left. WBTC is 0.\n- **arb1 (Arbitrum):** 147.6996 USDC (147699600) and 0.000113 ETH (113333333333333). That ETH is enough gas for 5 more transactions. WBTC is 0.\n\nNothing is still in transit.","outcome":{"kind":"target_reached"},"balances":{"eth1":{"ETH":"47900000000000000","WBTC":"0","USDC":"0"},"rh1":{"ETH":"49346533333333333","WBTC":"0"},"arb1":{"ETH":"113333333333333","WBTC":"0","USDC":"147699600"}},"in_transit_legs":[]},"id":"toolu_01GxoaXpZKUf9EJiJxuTQdHB"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":94,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"reported\":true}","toolCallId":"toolu_01GxoaXpZKUf9EJiJxuTQdHB","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_report_result","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":95,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The route finished and all 7 steps confirmed. Your 0.1 ETH was swapped to WBTC and split in half: one half became ETH on Robinhood Chain, the other became USDC on Arbitrum. Total cost was $10.22, under your $15.00 limit, and nothing is still moving between chains.\n\n| Wallet | Balance now |\n|---|---|\n| Ethereum (`eth1`) | 0.0479 ETH, no WBTC or USDC left |\n| Robinhood Chain (`rh1`) | 0.049347 ETH (0.049213 from the swap, plus gas ETH left over) |\n| Arbitrum (`arb1`) | 147.6996 USDC, plus 0.000113 ETH, enough gas for about 5 more transactions |\n\nThe 0.1 ETH bought 495,000 sats of WBTC. Each half lost about 834 sats to the bridge fee on the way to its chain, so 246,666 sats were swapped on each side."}]}],"completeness":{"transcriptCaptureComplete":true,"modelObservedTruncation":false,"auxiliarySourceComplete":true,"finalAnswerPresent":true,"nativeVisibleEvidenceAvailable":true},"gaps":[],"publication":{"kind":"public_redacted","sourceConversationSha256":"5480187b1e410ddd89bbc0351288a657684b40563197eb7ab1a784fc31c636c4","redactions":{}}}}
